.TH "PACE ACTIVITY LIST" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace activity list Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-activity\-list \- List recent activities.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace activity list
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List recent activities.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-n,\fP \-\-limit INTEGER
Max activities to return.  [default: 20]
.TP
\fB\-t,\fP \-\-type TEXT
Filter by activity type (e.g. running, cycling).
.TP
\fB\-f,\fP \-\-format [table|json|csv|md]
.PP
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-cache\fP
.PP
